{"id": "t089-001", "text": "Thabo's daughter graduates from Leeds on June 3rd. He's flying her grandparents over from Durban for it. Remind me to send a card the week before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduates from Leeds", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandparents", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t089-004", "text": "Graham's mum is having her hip replaced on 5/14. Dr Banerjee is doing the operation. Graham is taking the whole week off to look after her and his dad, who can't really cope on his own anymore. I should call him the weekend after to see how she's getting on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her hip replaced", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Banerjee", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the whole week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't really cope on his own", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t089-005", "text": "Spoke to Eva after book club. Her brother Darius has just finished his medical finals and gets his results in a fortnight. She says he's barely sleeping.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after book club"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Darius", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "medical finals", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "results", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "barely sleeping", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t089-006", "text": "Eamon and his wife celebrate their 25th anniversary on July 9th. They're having dinner at the place by the harbour. He hinted she'd love a framed print of their wedding venue.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eamon", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "25th anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner at the place by the harbour", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a framed print of their wedding venue", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t089-008", "text": "Chiara's little girl lost her first tooth yesterday and is now trying to negotiate a better rate with the tooth fairy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little girl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost her first tooth", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t089-013", "text": "Dana's twins start nursery on Monday, and she's going back to work part time the same week, so it's going to be chaos in their house. Her mother-in-law is meant to be helping with pickups but has just broken her wrist. Text Dana on Monday evening to see how the first day went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to work part time", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mother-in-law", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broken her wrist", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text Dana", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t089-014", "text": "Mia rang. Her dog Biscuit had an operation on his back leg on Saturday. He's home now but on crate rest for six weeks, which he hates.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks"}]}
{"id": "t089-016", "text": "Caught up with Jada over coffee. Her mum has been unwell since the summer and they finally have a diagnosis appointment on November 4th. Jada is driving up to Glasgow the Sunday before to be with her. Meanwhile her eldest, Imogen, is sitting her GCSE mocks that same week, so Jada is being pulled in every direction and sounds exhausted. I should message her on the 4th, and maybe drop a lasagne round once she's back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "unwell", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the summer"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "diagnosis appointment", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 4th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up to Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sunday before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imogen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "GCSE mocks", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that same week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "being pulled in every direction", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop a lasagne round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "once she's back", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t089-017", "text": "Jack and Teresa are expecting their second baby in March. Teresa has had awful morning sickness, so they haven't told many people yet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "awful morning sickness", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}]}
{"id": "t089-018", "text": "Bogdan Wright from work said his daughter got into Edinburgh to study architecture. He's over the moon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan Wright", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into Edinburgh", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "study architecture", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t089-019", "text": "Sofia is the narrator in the school play on Thursday. Her dad Abebe says she's been practising her lines in the bath every night. Wish her luck on Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "school play", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Wish her luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t089-020", "text": "Yusuf is moving to Bristol in a fortnight for the new job. His girlfriend is staying in London until her lease ends in January, and then they'll look for somewhere together. He seems excited but a bit daunted by the long-distance part.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "staying in London", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until her lease ends in January"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "look for somewhere together", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit daunted by the long-distance part", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t089-021", "text": "Note to self: renew passport before the trip. Get the photos done this weekend, then fill in the online form.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "renew passport", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Get the photos done", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "fill in the online form", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t089-022", "text": "Alice told me her sister Kerry has finally finished her PhD. The viva went well and graduation is in December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kerry", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viva", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduation", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t089-027", "text": "Groceries tonight, gym at 7 tomorrow, then the dentist at 2. Busy one.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Groceries", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "7 tomorrow", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "the dentist", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "2", "anchor": "a3"}]}
{"id": "t089-046", "text": "Plan for Saturday: farmers market first thing, then paint the spare room. Sunday is a rest day.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "farmers market", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "first thing", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "paint the spare room", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday"}]}
{"id": "t089-047", "text": "Rhys's daughter finishes uni on June 20th and already has a graduate job lined up in Manchester.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rhys", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 20th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduate job", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}]}
{"id": "t089-049", "text": "Lunch with Chiara and Darius. They want a small wedding next summer, probably in Puglia where Chiara's grandparents live, but Darius's mum is pushing hard for a big church do at home. Chiara seems quite stressed by it all. They're going to look at venues over Easter. Remind me to ask Chiara how it went when they're back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Darius", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "small wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandparents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Darius", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "look at venues", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over Easter", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Chiara how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "when they're back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t089-052", "text": "Dorota and her partner adopted a rescue greyhound called Luna last week. She's very shy and hides behind the sofa.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dorota", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "adopted", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rescue greyhound called Luna", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t089-053", "text": "Pay the council tax, then sort out the boiler service. The engineer can come Wednesday between 8 and 12.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pay the council tax", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort out the boiler service", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday between 8 and 12", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t089-056", "text": "Jada said her mum's appointment went better than expected. It's not cancer, just a cyst. Huge relief all round.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appointment", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cyst", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Huge relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t089-059", "text": "Teresa mentioned her brother Bogdan has split up with his fiancée and moved back in with their parents. The wedding is off, obviously. He's taking it badly. I should message him this week, and maybe invite him to the pub quiz on Thursday to get him out of the house.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "fiancée", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved back in", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "taking it badly", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite him to the pub quiz", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pub quiz", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
